    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1038">

                <pb facs="0894" n="778" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg778"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.002/23.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1351.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 9, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to transmit herewith copies of my
                    letter to Mr. Calero of the 8th instant and his reply of the 9th instant on the
                    occasion of his relinquishing the duties of Minister for Foreign Affairs for
                    Mexico.</p>
                <p>I have to-day telegraphed<anchor n="2" xml:id="d1038-f1"/> the Department that
                    Mr. Pedro Lascurain took the oath of office as Minister for Foreign Affairs
                    to-day, and at once took up the duties of his office.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry Lane Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d1038-a1.xml" xpointer="d1038-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d1038-a2.xml" xpointer="d1038-a2"/>
            </div>
